{"text": "\n\n**Pinecone Vector Database Pricing Details:**\n\n- **Starter Plan:**\n  - **Cost:** Free\n  - **Included Usage:** Pinecone Database On-Demand, Pinecone Inference, Pinecone Assistant, Dense, Sparse, and Full-Text Indexes, Console Metrics, Community Support via Discord.\n  - **Limits:** View included usage, suitable for trying out and small applications.\n\n- **Builder Plan:**\n  - **Cost:** $20/month flat\n  - **Included Usage:** Everything in Starter, increased usage limits, Prometheus and Datadog monitoring, free support.\n  - **Limits:** Suitable for solo developers and small teams.\n\n- **Standard Plan:**\n  - **Cost:** $50/month minimum, pay-as-you-go for usage over $50.\n  - **Included Usage:** Everything in Builder, Dedicated Read Nodes (DRN), Import from object storage, Backup and Restore, RBAC, SSO (SAML 2.0), HIPAA add-on, free support.\n  - **Limits:** Suitable for production applications at any scale.\n\n- **Enterprise Plan:**\n  - **Cost:** $500/month minimum, pay-as-you-go for usage over $500.\n  - **Included Usage:** Everything in Standard, 99.95% Uptime SLA, Bring Your Own Cloud (BYOC), Private Endpoints, Customer Managed Encryption Keys, Audit Logs, Service Accounts, SAML roles, SCIM, HIPAA Compliance, Pro support.\n  - **Limits:** Suitable for mission-critical production applications.\n\n- **Additional Features and Limits:**\n  - **Database Storage:** Up to 2 GB for Starter, 10 GB for Builder, unlimited for Standard and Enterprise.\n  - **Write Units:** Up to 2M/mo for Starter, 5M/mo for Builder, unlimited for Standard and Enterprise.\n  - **Read Units:** Up to 1M/mo for Starter, 2M/mo for Builder, unlimited for Standard and Enterprise.\n  - **Egress:** Up to 1GB/mo for Starter, 10GB/mo for Builder, unlimited for Standard and Enterprise.\n  - **Indexes:** Up to 5 for Starter, 10 per project for Builder, 20 per project for Standard, 200 per project for Enterprise.\n  - **Namespaces per Index:** 100 for Starter, 1,000 for Builder, 100,000 for Standard, 1,000,000 for Enterprise.\n  - **Embedding Models:** All available models for all plans.\n  - **Reranking Models:** bge-reranker-v2-m3 only for Starter and Builder, all available models for Standard and Enterprise.\n\n- **Committed Use Contracts:** Larger usage commitments unlock bigger discounts and support.\n\n- **Security and Compliance:** Encryption at rest and in transit, RBAC, Audit Logs, Private Endpoints, Customer Managed Encryption Keys, SOC 2, GDPR, ISO 27001, HIPAA.\n"}